# Should schools provide physical education to students? Why and how?
Yes, I strongly believe schools should provide physical education. One main reason is that it helps students stay active and maintain good health, especially since many of them spend long hours sitting in class. Regular exercise can also reduce stress and improve concentration, which is beneficial for academic performance.

In terms of how it should be implemented, schools could include regular PE classes in the timetable and offer a variety of sports so students can choose what they enjoy. They could also organize extracurricular activities like sports clubs or competitions to encourage participation. Overall, physical education plays an important role in both students’ physical and mental development.

# How we can use technology to keep fit?
I think technology can be very helpful in keeping fit. For example, fitness apps can track your daily activities, such as steps, calories burned, and workout time, which helps people stay motivated. In addition, wearable devices like smartwatches can monitor heart rate and provide real-time feedback during exercise. Technology also makes it easier to access online without classes, so people can exercise at home without needing to go to the gym. Overall, it makes fitness more convenient and personalized.s

# Do you think it is good for goverments to utilize popular celebrities to help build health awareness?
Yes, I think it can be a good idea for governments to use popular celebrities to promote health awareness. Celebrities often have a large following, especially among young people, so their messages can reach a wider audience and have a stronger impact. For example, if a well-known figure promotes healthy habits like exercising or eating well, people may be more likely to follow their advice.

However, it’s important to choose the right celebrities—those who have a positive image and actually live a healthy lifestyle. Otherwise, the message might not be taken seriously. Overall, I think it’s an effective strategy if it’s used carefully.

# How can parents help and guide their kids to keep healthy?
I think parents play a very important role in helping their children stay healthy. First of all, they can encourage good habits, such as eating balanced meals and exercising regularly. For example, parents can cook healthy food at home and limit junk food. In addition, they can set a good example by maintaining a healthy lifestyle themselves, because children often copy what they see. Parents can also make physical activities more enjoyable by doing them together, like going for walks or playing sports. Overall, guidance and support from parents can have a lasting impact on children’s health.
